---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How we work — Blackbook Racing Club"
  description="Methodology, ledger, and what we don't do. A small UK team of horse racing enthusiasts publishing timestamped picks reconciled to Betfair SP."
>
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Methodology &amp; ledger</h1>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        We are a small UK-based team of horse racing enthusiasts. We've been building, refining,
        and backtesting our blackbook methodology on decades of UK racing data — and we're still
        doing it every day.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        Every UK race day, we run the field through our methodology, the team reviews the
        strongest plays of the day, and we publish them on Telegram and the public ledger. Every
        selection is timestamped before the off. Every result is reconciled to Betfair SP after
        the race.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Our methodology</h2>
      <p>
        We assess every UK runner across a deep stack of signals — speed figures, handicap
        context, market behaviour, trainer/jockey form, and our own private indicators built on
        decades of historical data. A selection only fires when a runner clears the threshold on
        a stream we've validated across our extensive backtest history. Every morning, the team
        reviews the day's slate before publication.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>How we measure ourselves</h2>
      <p>
        The full ledger is public. Timestamps are pre-off. Settlements reconcile to Betfair SP.
        We publish losers alongside winners and per-race-code performance — including the
        courses where we don't have an edge.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>
        Claim guaranteed returns. Post stakes after the result. Hide losing months. Sell systems
        we wouldn't bet ourselves.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>The Blackbook</h2>
      <p>
        Members in the Blackbook tier get our curated list of horses worth tracking — animals
        our team has flagged across multiple runs and expects to fire when conditions align.
        Every entry has a reason and a target run window.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .page {
      padding-top: 16px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 40px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .block {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .block + .block {
      padding-top: 36px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .block h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .block p {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page-title {
        font-size: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .block h2 {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .block p {
        font-size: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
